& [IR2ImplementationProofPackInvalidationRuleSet] is the staleness contract for IR2ParserProjectionImplementationProofPackV1
  + [invalidated_by] is change to any accepted implementation output hash
  + [invalidated_by] is change to any accepted fixture or expected-ledger hash
  + [invalidated_by] is change to generated-output proof or contract tests
  + [invalidated_by] is change to IR2-IA01 through IR2-IA07 completion reviews that affects support, requirements, or gates
  + [invalidated_by] is generated projection promoted to source authority
  + [invalidated_by] is source mutation by parser/projection runtime
  + [invalidated_by] is dependency installation without authorizing slice
  + [invalidated_by] is operations control or live machine control leak

  = must: rerun IR2-IA07 or rebake the relevant surface after invalidation before IR3 consumes this proof pack
